      `the day the most recent order was made` IS A DATE
      `the day in question` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 490.015(2) the person subject to more than one order may apply for a termination order` MEANS
    IF `the person is subject to more than one order made under section 490.012 of this Act, or under that section and section 227.01 of the National Defence Act` AND `the day in question` AT LEAST `add years` `the day the most recent order was made` 20
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

