    `s 490.016(1.1)(c) the nature and circumstances of the relationship between the person and the victim`
    `s 490.016(1.1)(d) the personal characteristics and circumstances of the person`
    `s 490.016(1.1)(e) the person’s criminal history, including the age at which they previously committed any offence and the length of time for which they have been at liberty without committing an offence`
    `s 490.016(1.1)(f) the opinions of experts who have examined the person`
